	<summary>Browse S3, SFTP, NFS and SMB storage</summary>

	<description>
		<p>Rabbit Storage Explorer is a fast, native file explorer for S3-compatible object storage, SFTP (SSH), NFS and SMB network shares.</p>
		<p>Upload thousands of files at once by dragging and dropping them anywhere in the window. Transfers run in parallel with automatic retries, live progress and per-file details, and can be cancelled at any time.</p>
		<p>Optional end-to-end encryption protects both file contents and file names: everything is encrypted on your machine before upload, so the server only ever sees ciphertext. Connection secrets are stored in the system keychain, and SSH host keys are verified on every connection.</p>
	</description>

